--[[
	WeaponConfig
	Every weapon in the game. Add a weapon by appending an entry to List;
	ConfigValidator checks it at server start (see DESIGN.md "Adding a weapon").

	Slot rules:
	  Kinetic  primary weapons, always Kinetic element
	  Energy   primary or special weapons, always an energy element
	  Heavy    heavy weapons, always an energy element

	Sources say where a weapon can drop (LootConfig uses them):
	  Starter, World, Story, Patrol, Strike, Nightfall, Dungeon, Raid, PvP,
	  Vendor, Quest, ExoticPool (random exotic drops from any activity)

	Model is the name of a placeholder model under
	ReplicatedStorage.Assets.Weapons (replace with your own meshes).
]]

